# 9. Two demos side by side

This example shows the same demo twice in a slide, to compare two methods: a plane deformed in its vertex shader,
on the left with the exact normals of the deformed surface, on the right with the normals of the flat plane. The
shape is the same, the lighting is not. One slider of the slide sets the amplitude of both.

